app.db
# Ban sao luu tu dong truoc MOI lan chay pipeline (api._backup_db) va tep
# hong bi doi ten khi phuc hoi (recovery.py) — deu la BAN SAO DAY DU cua
# du lieu hoc sinh, nam ngay canh app.db, tuc thu muc goc khi chay tu ma
# nguon. Luat `app.db` o tren KHONG bat duoc chung vi khac ten tep.
*.db.bak-*
*.db.corrupt-*
app.db-journal
# Log loi (chan_doan.py): co duong dan may va doan du lieu gay loi.
loi_khoi_dong.txt
loi_ung_dung.txt
# File ket qua xuat ra — la DU LIEU HOC SINH, khong bao gio duoc vao git.
# Ten mac dinh cua export_csv la ket_qua_phan_bo.csv, kem thu muc
# ket_qua_phan_bo_theo_club/. Chan rong de bat ca cac ten khac.
match_results.csv
ket_qua*.csv
ket_qua*_theo_club/
# Ban nhieu buoi xuat them HAI thu muc nua. Luat `ket_qua*.csv` o tren
# KHONG chan duoc chung: gitignore khop theo TEN TEP, ma ten tep ben trong
# la `thu_2.csv` / `clb_bongda.csv` — khong bat dau bang "ket_qua". Da thu
# bang git check-ignore. Thieu hai dong nay la ho ten hoc sinh that di
# thang vao git.
ket_qua*_theo_buoi/
ket_qua*_danh_sach_cho/

# NGOAI LE: ket_qua_thu_tai.csv la SO DO THU TAI, khong phai du lieu hoc
# sinh. Ca 18 cot deu la so dem va thoi gian (so hoc sinh, so CLB, giay,
# MB); cot chu duy nhat chi nhan hai gia tri "chia_deu"/"theo_nhu_cau".
# Day la du lieu THO dung sau bao cao thu tai — thieu no thi
# bao_cao_thu_tai.html khong ai dung lai duoc, ma README lai dang tro
# toi. Luat ket_qua*.csv o tren chan nham no chi vi trung tien to ten.
!du_lieu_test/thu_tai/ket_qua_thu_tai.csv
# PHAN HOI KHAO SAT — DU LIEU HOC SINH CO THAT, khac han moi bo du lieu
# trong du_lieu_test/ (deu la may sinh). Day la cau tra loi cua hoc sinh
# that, phan lon la tre vi thanh nien. Khong bao gio duoc vao git.
#
# Chan theo DUOI BANG TINH chu khong theo ten, vi Google Forms dat ten
# mac dinh khac nhau tuy ngon ngu: "... (Responses)" hoac "... (Phan hoi)".
# Chi bang tinh moi bi chan, nen ban thân BO CAU HOI (docs/KHAO_SAT_CAU_HOI.md)
# van vao git binh thuong — do la cong cu do, khong phai du lieu.
*(Responses)*.csv
*(Responses)*.xlsx
*Responses*.csv
*Responses*.xlsx
*hản hồi*.csv
*hản hồi*.xlsx
phan_hoi*.csv
phan_hoi*.xlsx
khao_sat*.csv
khao_sat*.xlsx
KHAO_SAT*.csv
KHAO_SAT*.xlsx
#
# 02/09: du an chuyen sang MICROSOFT FORMS. Cac luat tren viet cho Google
# Forms va KHONG chan duoc ten Microsoft Forms dat. Da thu bang
# git check-ignore, ca bon deu LOT:
#     KHAO SAT Quy trinh & Muc do hai long...(1-53).xlsx   (co dau)
#     KHAO SAT(1-12).xlsx
#     Form1(1-53).xlsx
#     Khao sat CLB.xlsx
# Luat KHAO_SAT* KHONG khop "KHAO SAT" co dau va co khoang trang.
#
# Microsoft Forms dat ten "<ten form>(1-53).xlsx" — chan theo hinh dang do:
*(1-*).xlsx
*(1-*).csv
# Ten form tieng Viet CO DAU:
*KHẢO SÁT*.xlsx
*KHẢO SÁT*.csv
*Khảo sát*.xlsx
*Khảo sát*.csv
*khảo sát*.xlsx
*khảo sát*.csv
#
# LUOI CHAN CUOI: chan MOI bang tinh o THU MUC GOC du an. Ten tep Forms
# xuat ra khong doan truoc duoc, ma thu muc goc la cho de roi tep vao
# nhat. Bo mau va bo du lieu test deu nam trong thu muc con nen khong bi
# anh huong. Neu that su can mot bang tinh o goc thi mo khoa rieng bang
# dong "!ten_tep.xlsx".
/*.xlsx
/*.csv

build/
dist/

